WEBVTT

00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:18.650
You're pushing it, Yukina.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.570
Sh-She's so strong.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:33.170
So this is Origami Yukari.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:37.330
How immature...

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:42.390
If you would draw Juzumaru, we could 
break through this much easier.

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:45.360
A momentary victory is meaningless.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:49.060
I've been abandoned by Princess
Tagitsu and Princess Takiri

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:52.020
and now I wander this world alone...

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:56.770
Yukari, I am exhausted.

00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:02.510
Really? If you can still talk 
so much, then you're fine.

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:03.610
Let's go.

00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:06.210
You slave driver.

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:36.920
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:43.380
<b>Episode 20  The Last Goddess</b>

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:40.040
They escaped?!

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:46.800
Nevertheless, your skill in finding 
Origami Yukari is appreciated.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:50.880
I will send over reinforcements promptly, 
so please take care of this tonight.

00:02:52.710 --> 00:02:55.110
If I didn't have to handle negotiations 
with those philistines,

00:02:55.110 --> 00:02:57.620
I'd go take care of things myself.

00:02:57.620 --> 00:02:59.900
It's a matter of being the 
right person for the job.

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:04.400
You simply need to handle the 
tasks that only you can do.

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.180
Princess! Leave it to me.

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:11.370
Make sure you make it interesting.

00:03:13.880 --> 00:03:16.080
According to the report 
I received from Rui-san,

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:19.150
she parted ways with my sister and 
Princess Ichikishima on the Choshi coast,

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:21.920
and they are heading north 
trying to avoid notice.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:26.960
We've confirmed that Princess Tagitsu's 
forces have already made contact with them,

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.870
but in light of public opinion
 and the government,

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:33.310
we believe even they can't go all out
 because of the attention it would draw.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:36.610
Which means we will need 
to secure them promptly

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.560
without drawing attention, either.

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:43.400
That's right, and while you're 
at it, please secure Rui, too.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.030
While we're at it?

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:49.700
Rui-rui lived a life unloved
by her job and superiors.

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:54.730
Tap, tap! The Sword Administration Bureau
 is a black company after all.

00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:59.010
Don't go spreading jokes on the Internet

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.450
that will turn public 
opinion further against us.

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.550
Are you trying to make me 
stop growing or something?

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:07.170
Stop growing?

00:04:07.170 --> 00:04:11.520
Hey, stop it. Don't look at 
me with such an innocent gaze.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:19.230
You seem relaxed now.
You should get going, then.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:20.060
Yes, ma'am!

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:28.190
Etou, have you got a moment?

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:31.940
What is it? You're being
 so formal, Shidou-san.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:36.400
I'm only going to say this to you,
 but about Juujou Hiyori...

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:43.110
I know. She hasn't been focusing on anything.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:45.510
Of course you've already noticed.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:47.350
There's been so much that's happened

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:51.010
with things twenty years ago and now with
 Princess Takiri and Princess Ichikishima.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:55.140
She could be dangerous 
like this, so be careful.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:12.340
You seem to be a bit 
tense yourself, Naa-chan.

00:05:12.340 --> 00:05:16.080
You haven't called me that 
in a long time, Akane-chan.

00:05:16.470 --> 00:05:19.390
The imperial guard's movements 
are far too precise.

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:23.440
It's as if they have completely grasped 
the bureau director's actions.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.840
The mastermind must be...

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.820
...her, right?

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:32.470
As a vice captain, she was able to 
make quick and precise movements

00:05:32.470 --> 00:05:35.170
by reviewing every situation.

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:38.420
She was a reliable comrade 
to have twenty years ago.

00:05:45.310 --> 00:05:47.480
So even you get tired.

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:51.490
You would be, too, fending off such 
attacks in rapid succession.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:57.490
They have all devoted themselves 
to Princess Tagitsu.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:59.920
My wish is

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:04.310
to sublimate humans to great 
heights by fusion with aradama.

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:08.880
I just wanted to prove that 
my existence wasn't unnecessary.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:13.030
But no one desires such lofty ideals.

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:16.160
I am so tired.

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.890
Are you giving up?

00:06:17.890 --> 00:06:20.830
No one around me will forgive me.

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:24.020
I see. That is none of my concern.

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:25.140
Yukari?

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:30.000
I made the decision to protect you 
whether anyone forgives you or not.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:31.760
Yes, that's right.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:34.260
Regardless of what anyone wants,

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:37.160
I won't hand you over to Princess Tagitsu.

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:40.330
I don't understand.

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:43.310
Why don't you break?

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:47.060
We were with you for twenty years,

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:50.990
and yet you constantly endured our intrusion.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:55.550
Where does such strength come from?

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:56.850
Do you want to know?

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:01.010
Then I will tell you.

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:06.260
You won't be able to understand 
just by watching, so speak with me.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:09.310
Communicating your intentions 
through conversation?

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.710
Humans are indeed immature, as you've said.

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:16.450
To say that we can understand each
other without speaking is nonsense.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:20.470
After speaking with you... For example,

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:23.970
I was surprised to learn how 
unexpectedly talkative you are.

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:26.480
I used to think you were the silent type.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:29.710
Honestly, it puzzled me at first.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:31.930
Well, um...

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:37.680
I'm not very good at it myself, but this
 is how humans understand each other.

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:41.740
Though it can be troublesome to
understand each other too much...

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:48.930
Yes, you would be the only 
one to trace me here, Yuzuki.

00:07:51.020 --> 00:07:54.110
You're easy to figure out, Yukari.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:57.830
It's been a while,
though I guess I can't say that.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.930
I was just with you doing 
research until recently.

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:06.380
But it's been about twenty years since 
I last saw you being fully yourself.

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.950
Twenty years is a long time.

00:08:23.070 --> 00:08:26.050
<i>Why are people so easily...</i>

00:08:29.660 --> 00:08:31.900
<i>What has this girl done?</i>

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:36.020
<i>While maintaining such 
a precarious balance...</i>

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:39.580
<i>Why is the world so unfair?</i>

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.180
<i>Unfair.</i>

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:53.790
<i>This is to resist that unfairness.</i>

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:57.060
I had a dream I wanted to realize,

00:08:57.060 --> 00:09:00.570
even if it meant turning my back on the 
right path and going down the wrong one.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:04.430
But the true identity of the 
dream that I believed was noble

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:07.850
was just the ugly and misguided 
extremes of my ego.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:11.930
And I forced my egotism onto those girls.

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:18.360
You didn't come all this way 
just to reminisce, did you?

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:21.730
No, I had faith that you would 
repel the imperial guard,

00:09:21.730 --> 00:09:26.910
protect Princess Ichikishima,
and come to me.

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.970
Please condemn me, Yukari.

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:33.840
I have sinned too much.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:40.880
I don't have the right to condemn you.

00:09:41.590 --> 00:09:43.380
Why, Yukari?

00:09:43.840 --> 00:09:48.540
I gave Yume a transient happiness
 that lead to a cruel end.

00:09:49.260 --> 00:09:52.450
I crushed the earnest feelings of young girls.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:55.650
All of it was because of my weakness.

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:59.790
That's why I came in their place.

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:03.840
Twenty years ago... no, even before then,

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:05.740
I always depended on you,

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.690
and you always supported me.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:14.090
I am the one who should
be condemned, since your weakness

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:17.820
is the weakness I have given you.

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:21.420
Yukari...

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:42.110
Yomi.

00:10:44.520 --> 00:10:49.910
Princess Ichikishima, I have 
come for you on my master's orders.

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:51.750
Princess Tagitsu, huh?

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.910
You let me come here?

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:57.470
Yukari!

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:02.450
Yukari...

00:11:02.450 --> 00:11:05.170
Satsuki Yomi will be in 
command going forward.

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:07.680
Please have the imperial 
guard and other units

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:12.350
follow the aradama signal I attached 
to the target and gather there.

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:16.440
Now then, please excuse me,
 President Souraku.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:19.410
You don't need to purge the traitor?

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:22.770
You have done your duty by leading me

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:25.190
to Princess Ichikishima.

00:11:25.190 --> 00:11:29.120
I see. So I'm not going to 
be condemned or killed.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.310
So that is my sin.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:34.450
Honestly, I do not really care 
about what happens to you.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.700
However, I will say this...

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:43.050
It's entirely on you if you wish to 
condemn yourself as a corrupt sinner.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.320
But even if it is ugly and misguided,

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:49.200
we are the ones who chose this 
way of life for ourselves.

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:52.750
We will not be condemned by anyone.

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:10.700
We've fought this many times before.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:14.730
Satsuki-san called on her aradama again here.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:16.940
Hiyori-chan?

00:12:17.510 --> 00:12:19.210
Yeah, you're right.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:23.210
Hiyori-chan!

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:25.360
What's with you all of a sudden, Kanami?

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:28.510
For now, let's follow the 
tracks and go after them!

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:31.130
After that... We'll figure out the rest.

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:33.150
Figure it out?

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.930
H-Hey, Kanami.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:42.590
Nene-chan has apparently 
found Princess Ichikishima.

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:44.110
Let's meet up with the others.

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:45.940
Got it, where at?

00:12:56.450 --> 00:12:58.550
This place is like a labyrinth.

00:12:58.550 --> 00:13:02.460
Rather fitting for someone like me, 
who cannot see where she is going.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:07.650
However, all the things that are here 
are indispensable to human livelihoods,

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:11.470
which is vastly different 
from my useless existence.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:13.170
This may sound like a joke,

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:15.950
but is it possible for you 
to fuse with me again?

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.470
It is not.

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:23.980
Once the three of us were gone,
 you were no longer...

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:33.490
Origami Yukari-sama, Princess Ichikishima,

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:35.740
we will be taking you in!

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.840
Sorry we're late, Yukari-sama!

00:13:50.150 --> 00:13:51.720
You...

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:54.660
We'll deal with them.
Get as far away as you can!

00:13:54.660 --> 00:13:56.930
Leave this to us, and go on!

00:13:56.930 --> 00:14:00.850
Yes! I got to say it. Now I have no regrets.

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:02.190
I'm sorry!

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:04.650
Wait!

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:09.070
Wh-What?!

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:17.280
So flashy!

00:14:17.280 --> 00:14:18.240
Amazing.

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:19.910
Let's go, girls!

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:21.100
Right!

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:43.980
Kanami-chan and Hiyori-chan, you two go 
guard Yukari-sama and Princess Ichikishima!

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:45.100
Hurry!

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:45.970
Got it!

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:47.280
Come on, Hiyori-chan.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.000
Okay.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:48.980
Etou-san!

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:53.520
I've been waiting so long for this.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:55.450
For the day when I could fight you.

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:57.460
Let's do this, Etou-san!

00:14:57.460 --> 00:15:01.200
We can have a totally serious 
clash like we did at Ichigaya.

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:03.440
A-Ayumu-chan...

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.050
Yomi...

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:22.430
What is she doing without her utsushi?

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:28.440
I do not have any more of my 
life to give to defeat you,

00:15:28.850 --> 00:15:30.710
so please come at me with intent to kill,

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.380
and I will do the same.

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:50.540
Kashima Shrine... dedicated to the god
 of thunder and martial arts, Takemikazuchi.

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:54.410
And the home of the Kashima Shintou style.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:58.370
I've visited here with 
Kagari and Yuzuki before.

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:01.720
Is something wrong?

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:06.730
It is the humans that you need.

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:08.980
While I...

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:12.950
Why do you think I was 
able to hold on to myself

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.280
while playing host to the great aradama?

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:19.680
It is because you were with me.

00:16:20.220 --> 00:16:21.620
Me?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:26.350
Tormented by Princess Tagitsu's relentlessness
and Princess Takiri's rationality,

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:29.120
day by day, my humanity
was gradually slipping away.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:32.710
But I was able to remain 
a person because you,

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:36.630
the cautious, timid, and self-deprecating 
Princess Ichikishima,

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.860
were within me.

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:42.470
You are not an unnecessary existence.

00:16:42.470 --> 00:16:46.010
I need you more than anyone else.

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:49.020
Yukari...

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:52.520
Are you finished?

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:04.570
Have you been well? I've missed you,
 Princess Ichikishima.

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:06.450
Princess Tagitsu...

00:17:06.450 --> 00:17:11.960
Be mine, and I will give you meaning.

00:17:12.470 --> 00:17:15.960
Princess Tagitsu... I won't let that happen!

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:22.790
Kanami!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:24.030
Go, Hiyori-chan!

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:25.480
Okay!

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:27.260
Please stop this, Ayumu-chan.

00:17:27.260 --> 00:17:28.710
Why should I?

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:33.020
This is my mission, and we're Toji. 
Toji are meant to fight together.

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:36.350
And I got stronger so I could fight with you.

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:38.480
That's why I'll fight you 
with everything I've got!

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:48.910
Yomi, you can still come back from this!

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:52.620
And you are all right with 
suppressing aradama, Shidou-san?

00:17:52.620 --> 00:17:56.450
I am, because I have someone 
more reliable than an aradama now!

00:17:56.450 --> 00:18:01.340
Well, that is rather jarring,
 but I'll accept the flattery.

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:05.340
Is this really the strength you wanted?

00:18:05.340 --> 00:18:08.100
Yes, so I could fight with you!

00:18:08.100 --> 00:18:11.120
See? I've gotten stronger, haven't I?

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:15.570
Okay, then I can't fight with you.

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:17.860
Why not?

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.110
Princess Ichikishima, hurry and
 get away from here.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.820
You doddering old fool.

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:28.640
You were even once our...

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:32.290
No, now you are just a broken vessel.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.340
Stop this, Yukari.

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:44.450
You are not an unnecessary existence.

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:48.340
I need you more than anyone else.

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:50.600
Yukari...

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.600
Do not...

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:01.390
...touch Yukari!

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:07.820
Yukari, just hang on a moment!

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:12.330
Good. That's for the best.

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:16.430
The first time I met you, I thought,

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:20.500
"This girl loves swordfighting 
just as much as I do,"

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:22.370
and I was so glad.

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.190
I thought that it would be fun

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:27.720
if we gradually strengthened 
our swordsmanship together.

00:19:27.720 --> 00:19:31.430
Fun? I don't understand any of that!

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:33.180
I know.

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:41.820
Because I just put
everything into this strike.

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:45.210
I know you will able to accept it.

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:52.480
You are... Princess Ichikishima?

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:55.850
I want you to lend me your power.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:20:00.460
No, I want to entrust my power to you.

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:04.960
Don't be ridiculous!

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:07.590
You used to be part of Princess Tagitsu!

00:20:07.590 --> 00:20:10.470
You're no different from the great 
aradama who tormented my mother!

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.830
So why would I...

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:18.430
Even so, I want to entrust 
myself to you, Juujou Hiyori.

00:20:18.430 --> 00:20:21.630
I want to save Origami Yukari.

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:40.580
It is all right if you resent me.

00:20:40.580 --> 00:20:44.090
You are welcome to resent 
me as well, Yomi-san.

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:52.300
You can't come back anymore, can you?

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:55.450
No, I can't.

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:58.730
No matter how twisted the path might be,

00:20:59.600 --> 00:21:02.100
as long as that person walks it...

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:14.700
Now, then, it is time to die.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.580
Takemikazuchi? It can't be!

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:38.850
Kogarasumaru? Juujou Hiyori...

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:43.730
So you have found a new vessel,
 Princess Ichikishima.

00:21:43.730 --> 00:21:46.860
Hiyori-chan! Yukari-sama!

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:51.110
Hiyori-chan! What in the world is going on?

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:54.340
Where's Princess Ichikishima? Where is she?

00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:55.930
Hey, Hiyori-chan?

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:02.650
H-Hiyori-chan...?

